Orient: Nacre palette engine

The current eight implementation modules were independently authored from the
behavior specification, public mathematical definitions, Pillow APIs and compatible
CLI/output contracts. LICENSE retains the project's current GPL-3.0-only choice.
No Material You or Caelestia implementation module is imported.

OKLab equations/matrices follow Björn Ottosson's public-domain mathematical
definition: https://bottosson.github.io/posts/oklab/ . Pillow retains its own license.

Historical versions imported caelestia-dots/cli under GPL-3.0-only and credited
its contributors. Their source and credit remain in Git history. Nacre's specs,
origin records and final comparison document the replacement and previous exposure;
this is not a legal clean-room guarantee or ownership claim over dependencies.
